                   '    --label NAME — repeatable\n'
                   '    --reason {completed,not_planned}\n'
                   '    --pr N\n'
                   '\n'
                   'OPERATION NOTES\n'
                   '    For --operation comment, supply --body or --body-file. For label_add, '
                   'supply --label for each selected label; label_remove requires exactly one '
                   '--label. For close, supply --reason. For pr_link, supply --pr.\n'
                   '    label_add is sorted and deduplicated; label_remove accepts exactly one '
